hints.pseudocode:
go(pos, value, last):
  if pos == n: return 1 if value == target else 0
  for end in pos+1 .. n:
    if the part digits[pos..end) has a leading zero (and more than one digit): break
    num = number of the part
    if pos == 0: total += go(end, num, num)
    else: total += go(end, value + num, num)            (+)
                + go(end, value - num, -num)            (-)
                + go(end, value - last + last * num, last * num)   (*)
